; headlines.vla - the ticker: the Headlines sheet, a headline a row, of which the game
; shows one a day on its Overview, the row the day's market draw picks (docs/OMAKASE.md,
; FRONT.3). Words alone: one macro named after this file, whose body is one call of the
; library's strings. The source includes this file after its manifest, with every other
; include, and calls (headlines) where the sheet's rows belong. A headline moves no price
; until the events sheet gives the ticker teeth (SPECIAL.1). To add a row, read README.md
; beside this file: one line, in the voice of a financial newswire that has seen things,
; approved by a reviewer.

(defmacro (headlines)
  "the ticker: the Headlines sheet, a headline a row"
  (strings "Headlines"              ; the sheet, hidden among the tabs
    ("Headline" 100)                ; its one field: the header over its texts, and its width in characters
    ; each row: the headline
    ("Economists predict nine of the last three recessions.")
    ("Fed holds rates steady; markets read it as 'a sort of hug'.")
    ("Analyst upgrades stock to 'buy' after discovering they own it.")
    ("Board assures investors the losses are merely unrealized, 'like everything else'.")
    ("SEC announces new rule against funny business; definitions to follow.")
    ("Company announces 'strategic pivot to AI'; stock up 40%; company still sells ice cream.")
    ("Local man buys everything at the top; market tops.")
    ("Tulip prices surge; historians sigh.")
    ("Intern discovers rounding error worth $4 million; asks about a bonus; there isn't one.")
    ("Gold remains calm as the world panics; the world finds this annoying.")
    ))                              ; the sheet's end: a row added goes on a line above this one
